<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n110013" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑψόσε</span></b> , Adv. of motion, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>aloft, on high,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑψόσ᾽ ἀείρας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					10.465
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				9.240
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑψόσ᾽ ἀνέσχεθε χειρί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					10.461
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. δ᾽ αὐγὴ γίγνεται ἀΐσσουσα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					18.211
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ δ᾽ ὑ. γούνατ᾽ ἐπήδα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					21.302
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				324
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. δ᾽ ἄχνη σκίδναται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11.307
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				12.238
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κίονες ὑ. ἔχοντες</span>
			<i>high</i> reaching, <i><span class="en">
				19.38
			</span></i>. The two editions by Aristarchus gave <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑψόσε</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑψοῦ</span>
			respectively in <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				10.465
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				505
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				12.249
			</span></i>.</div>
